Melody D.Verified Buyer4.0The case is just what I was looking for, and I'm very happy with it, though I will say there is white tape around the MagSafe piece that isn't evenly placed - the edge is sticking up a bit on one side that isn't flush with the back of the case. It may be a quality issue and so I'm thinking about returning it for the same case in hopes it doesn't have this flaw. Also of note is that the MagSafe gold doesn't match the gold D rings and straps, but it's not a dealbreaker. Otherwise it's a beautiful case with a very slim and lightweight profile that lets the beauty of the phone shine through. I really wish Bandolier would allow purchasing the case, straps and other accessories separately - I already have the long gold strap and a similar but better gold wristlet chain ( the one that comes with this is a bit flimsy/cheap looking). One other note since I submitted a 5 star review for another case (Rayna) too soon - avoid the chrome cases! They start chipping and peeling within a month - love the look but it doesn't last. The all-black leather case (Remi) is still hands down my favorite. Anyway, all in all, I still think Bandolier does cases better than anyone else and I can still recommend this case.Would you like more information on the return process?Tell me about the return process!What's your return policy?How long do I have to return it?What if it's a defective product?Can I exchange it for a different style?Give us feedback
